        "eBPF program intercepts the packet and applies policies",
        "Identifies the destination VTEP and encapsulates with a VXLAN header"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Physical Network",
      "items": [
        "Carries the encapsulated packet to the destination host over underlay IPs",
        "Cilium uses VXLAN by default and also supports Geneve encapsulation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Receiving Host B",
